{"seq":23,"slug":"health-economics","title":"健康经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"健康经济学\">健康经济学</h1><p>把一台 MRI 机、一支疫苗、一张医院病床放到供需曲线上，会立刻发现普通市场的那套直觉几乎全部失灵：买方不知道自己需要什么，卖方同时是开处方的人，价格被保险层层遮蔽，而「不买」的代价可能是死亡。健康经济学就是这门专门研究「当标准市场假设大面积崩塌时，社会该如何配置医疗资源」的学科。它既不是医学，也不是普通的微观经济学，而是用经济学的工具去解剖一个被不确定性、信息不对称和强烈外部性反复扭曲的特殊领域。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四条逐层递进的主线展开，每一条都建立在前一条之上。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是<strong>基础与健康需求</strong>。我们先弄清健康这件商品到底特殊在哪里——它既是消费品又是投资品，既无法预先体验也难以转售，购买时还高度依赖医生代理。在此之上，Grossman 把健康当作会折旧的资本存量，给出了「人为什么、何时、投资多少在自己健康上」的统一框架。最后我们系统梳理医疗市场的各类失灵，尤其是 Arrow 在 1963 年点破的信息不对称，它是后面一切制度设计的起点。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是<strong>医疗供给与保险</strong>。既然不确定性无处不在，保险就成了刚需；但保险一旦介入，又催生了道德风险和逆向选择这两个经典难题。供给侧同样不老实：医生既诊断又供给，可能诱导出本不必要的需求；而医药行业则在专利垄断、巨额研发与可及性之间艰难权衡。这一章解释的是医疗系统里「钱怎么流、激励怎么扭」。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是<strong>经济评价与决策</strong>。资源永远不够，于是必须有人决定「这笔钱花在哪种治疗上最划算」。这里发展出成本效果分析、用 QALY 衡量健康产出的成本效用分析，以及把这些证据制度化的健康技术评估（HTA）。再往深处追问「一年健康的生命到底值多少钱」，就来到生命统计价值（VSL）这一既技术又伦理的核心。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是<strong>卫生系统与政策</strong>。把视角从单项技术拉高到整个国家乃至全球：钱从哪里筹、如何走向全民健康覆盖、为什么健康差距如此顽固地沿着收入和阶层分布，以及当一场大流行同时冲击所有国家时，经济学能告诉我们什么。</p>\n<p>四条主线合起来回答同一个问题：在一个标准市场注定失效的领域，人类如何尽量公平且高效地用有限资源换取更多、更平等的健康。读完整个 hub，你会获得一套既能分析个体就医选择、也能评判国家医保改革的统一经济学视角。建议从<a href=\"foundations/\">基础与健康需求</a>读起，依次推进到<a href=\"supply-insurance/\">医疗供给与保险</a>、<a href=\"evaluation-decision/\">经济评价与决策</a>与<a href=\"systems-policy/\">卫生系统与政策</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与健康需求","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-special-nature-of-health","title":"健康经济学导论与健康的特殊性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/intro-and-special-nature-of-health"},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-for-health-grossman","title":"健康的需求与 Grossman 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/demand-for-health-grossman"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-failure-information-asymmetry","title":"医疗市场失灵与信息不对称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/market-failure-information-asymmetry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-insurance","title":"医疗供给与保险","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"health-insurance-moral-hazard-adverse-selection","title":"医疗保险、道德风险与逆向选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/health-insurance-moral-hazard-adverse-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"provider-supply-induced-demand","title":"医疗服务供给与诱导需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/provider-supply-induced-demand"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmaceutical-economics-innovation","title":"医药经济学与创新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/pharmaceutical-economics-innovation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-decision","title":"经济评价与决策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-effectiveness-utility-qaly","title":"成本效果与成本效用分析（QALY）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision/cost-effectiveness-utility-qaly"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-technology-assessment","title":"健康技术评估（HTA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision/health-technology-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"value-of-health-vsl","title":"健康的价值与生命统计价值（VSL）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/evaluation-decision/value-of-health-vsl"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems-policy","title":"卫生系统与政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/systems-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"health-financing-universal-coverage","title":"卫生筹资与全民健康覆盖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/systems-policy/health-financing-universal-coverage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-equity-social-determinants","title":"健康公平与社会决定因素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/systems-policy/health-equity-social-determinants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-health-pandemic-economics","title":"全球健康与大流行经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/systems-policy/global-health-pandemic-economics"}]}]}